function ProgressPage({ progress }) {

  const sessions = progress.sessions || [];

  const bySkill = progress.aggregates?.bySkill || {};



  return (

    <div style={styles.card}>

      <SectionTitle

        title="Progress"

        subtitle="Tracks completion and time spent across assessments. This is descriptive history for planning and exploration."

      />

      <Spacer />

      <div style={{ display: "grid", gap: 10 }}>

        {SKILLS.map((skill) => {

          const agg = bySkill[skill] || {

            sessions: 0,

            totalTimeMs: 0,

            completionCounts: { stage1: 0, stage2: 0, stage3: 0, report: 0 },

          };

          const minutes = Math.round((agg.totalTimeMs || 0) / 60000);

          return (

            <div key={skill} style={{ ...styles.card, padding: 12 }}>

              <div style={{ display: "flex", justifyContent: "space-between" }}>

                <div style={{ fontWeight: 800 }}>{skill}</div>

                <div style={styles.pill}>{agg.sessions} sessions</div>

              </div>

              <Spacer h={8} />

              <div style={styles.small}>Time spent: ~{minutes} min</div>

              <div style={styles.small}>

                Completed stages (count): Stage 1: {agg.completionCounts.stage1 || 0} •

                Stage 2: {agg.completionCounts.stage2 || 0} • Stage 3:{" "}

                {agg.completionCounts.stage3 || 0} • Report:{" "}

                {agg.completionCounts.report || 0}

              </div>

            </div>

          );

        })}

      </div>



      <Spacer h={18} />

      <div style={{ fontWeight: 800, marginBottom: 8 }}>Recent sessions</div>

      <div style={{ display: "grid", gap: 10 }}>

        {sessions

          .slice()

          .reverse()

          .slice(0, 8)

          .map((s) => {

            const totalMs =

              (s.stageTimesMs?.stage1 || 0) +

              (s.stageTimesMs?.stage2 || 0) +

              (s.stageTimesMs?.stage3 || 0);

            const mins = Math.max(1, Math.round(totalMs / 60000));

            return (

              <div key={s.id} style={{ ...styles.card, padding: 12 }}>

                <div style={{ fontWeight: 800 }}>

                  {s.skill} • {s.context}

                </div>

                <div style={styles.small}>

                  Time spent: ~{mins} min • Stages completed:{" "}

                  {Object.keys(s.completedStages || {})

                    .filter((k) => s.completedStages[k])

                    .join(", ") || "—"}

                </div>

              </div>

            );

          })}

      </div>

    </div>

  );

}



/* ===========================

   Main App (single-file routing)

   =========================== */

export default function App() {

  const [route, setRoute] = React.useState("assessment"); // "assessment" | "progress"

  const [skill, setSkill] = React.useState("Coding");

  const [context, setContext] = React.useState("Job");



  const [stage, setStage] = React.useState(1); // 1,2,3,4(report)

  const [stage1Answers, setStage1Answers] = React.useState({});

  const [stage2Answers, setStage2Answers] = React.useState({});

  const [stage3Signals, setStage3Signals] = React.useState({});



  const [report, setReport] = React.useState(null);



  // Progress tracking session

  const [sessionId, setSessionId] = React.useState(null);

  const [stageStartAt, setStageStartAt] = React.useState(nowMs());

  const [progress, setProgress] = React.useState(() => loadProgress());



  function beginSession() {

    const id = `sess_${nowMs()}_${Math.random().toString(16).slice(2)}`;

    setSessionId(id);

    setStageStartAt(nowMs());

    Analytics.track("session_start", { id, skill, context });

    return id;

  }



  function endStage(stageKey) {

    const endAt = nowMs();

    const elapsed = Math.max(0, endAt - stageStartAt);

    setStageStartAt(endAt);



    setProgress((prev) => {

      const next = structuredClone(prev);

      const sess =

        next.sessions.find((x) => x.id === sessionId) ||

        (() => {

          const s = {

            id: sessionId,

            startedAt: nowMs(),

            endedAt: null,

            skill,

            context,

            stageTimesMs: { stage1: 0, stage2: 0, stage3: 0 },

            completedStages: { stage1: false, stage2: false, stage3: false, report: false },

          };

          next.sessions.push(s);

          return s;

        })();



      sess.stageTimesMs[stageKey] = (sess.stageTimesMs[stageKey] || 0) + elapsed;

      sess.completedStages[stageKey] = true;



      // update aggregates

      next.aggregates.bySkill = next.aggregates.bySkill || {};

      const agg =

        next.aggregates.bySkill[skill] ||

        (next.aggregates.bySkill[skill] = {

          sessions: 0,

          totalTimeMs: 0,

          completionCounts: { stage1: 0, stage2: 0, stage3: 0, report: 0 },

        });



      // ensure sessions count only once per session

      if (!sess._countedForAgg) {

        agg.sessions += 1;

        sess._countedForAgg = true;

      }



      agg.totalTimeMs += elapsed;

      agg.completionCounts[stageKey] = (agg.completionCounts[stageKey] || 0) + 1;



      saveProgress(next);

      return next;

    });

  }



  React.useEffect(() => {

    if (!sessionId && route === "assessment") beginSession();

    // eslint-disable-next-line react-hooks/exhaustive-deps

  }, [route]);



  function resetAssessment() {

    Analytics.track("assessment_reset", { skill, context });

    setStage(1);

    setStage1Answers({});

    setStage2Answers({});

    setStage3Signals({});

    setReport(null);

    const id = beginSession();

    setSessionId(id);

  }



  function finalizeReport() {

    const rep = buildInsights(skill, context, stage1Answers, stage2Answers, stage3Signals);

    setReport(rep);



    // mark report stage in progress

    setProgress((prev) => {

      const next = structuredClone(prev);

      const sess = next.sessions.find((x) => x.id === sessionId);

      if (sess) {

        sess.completedStages.report = true;

        next.aggregates.bySkill = next.aggregates.bySkill || {};

        const agg = next.aggregates.bySkill[skill];

        if (agg) agg.completionCounts.report = (agg.completionCounts.report || 0) + 1;

        sess.endedAt = nowMs();

      }

      saveProgress(next);

      return next;

    });



    Analytics.track("report_ready", { skill, context });

  }



  function exportReport() {

    if (!report) return;

    const payload = {

      version: "scre_report_v1",

      createdAt: new Date().toISOString(),

      report,

    };

    downloadTextFile(

      `SCRE_Report_${report.skill.replace(/\s+/g, "_")}_${Date.now()}.json`,

      JSON.stringify(payload, null, 2),

      "application/json"

    );

    Analytics.track("report_export", { skill: report.skill, context: report.context });

  }



  const canContinueStage1 = () => {

    const qs = STAGE1_QUESTIONS[skill] || [];

    return qs.every((q) => typeof stage1Answers?.[q.signal]?.value === "number");

  };



  const canContinueStage2 = () => {

    const qs = STAGE2_SITUATIONAL[skill] || [];

    return qs.every((q) => {

      const v = stage2Answers?.[q.signal];

      if (q.type === "text") return typeof v === "string" && v.trim().length > 0;

      return typeof v === "string" && v.length > 0;

    });

  };



  return (

    <div style={styles.app}>

      <div style={styles.nav}>

        <div style={{ fontWeight: 900, letterSpacing: 0.3 }}>SCRE</div>

        <button

          type="button"

          style={styles.navBtn(route === "assessment")}

          onClick={() => setRoute("assessment")}

        >

          Assessment

        </button>

        <button

          type="button"

          style={styles.navBtn(route === "progress")}

          onClick={() => setRoute("progress")}

        >

          Progress

        </button>

        <div style={{ flex: 1 }} />

        <div style={styles.pill}>

          Analytics: {Analytics.enabled ? "On" : "Off"}

        </div>

      </div>



      <div style={styles.container}>

        {route === "progress" ? (

          <ProgressPage progress={progress} />

        ) : (

          <div style={{ display: "grid", gap: 12 }}>

            <div style={styles.card}>

              <SectionTitle

                title="Setup"

                subtitle="Choose a skill and context. The assessment focuses on approach and exploration signals."

              />

              <Spacer />

              <Row style={{ flexWrap: "wrap" }}>

                <div style={{ minWidth: 240, flex: 1 }}>

                  <div style={styles.label}>Skill</div>

                  <select

                    value={skill}

                    onChange={(e) => {

                      setSkill(e.target.value);

                      resetAssessment();

                    }}

                    style={styles.input}

                  >

                    {SKILLS.map((s) => (

                      <option value={s} key={s}>

                        {s}

                      </option>

                    ))}

                  </select>

                </div>



                <div style={{ minWidth: 240, flex: 1 }}>

                  <div style={styles.label}>Context</div>

                  <select

                    value={context}

                    onChange={(e) => {

                      setContext(e.target.value);

                      resetAssessment();

                    }}

                    style={styles.input}

                  >

                    {CONTEXTS.map((c) => (

                      <option value={c} key={c}>

                        {c}

                      </option>

                    ))}

                  </select>

                </div>

              </Row>

              <Spacer />

              <div style={styles.small}>

                Stage flow: Stage 1 (signals) → Stage 2 (situations) → Stage 3

                (microtask reflection) → Report

              </div>

            </div>



            {stage === 1 ? (

              <>

                <Stage1

                  skill={skill}

                  answers={stage1Answers}

                  setAnswers={setStage1Answers}

                  context={context}

                />

                <Row style={{ justifyContent: "flex-end" }}>

                  <button

                    type="button"

                    style={styles.button("primary")}

                    onClick={() => {

                      if (!canContinueStage1()) return;

                      endStage("stage1");

                      setStage(2);

                      Analytics.track("stage1_complete", { skill, context });

                    }}

                  >

                    Continue <ArrowRight />

                  </button>

                </Row>

              </>

            ) : null}



            {stage === 2 ? (

              <>

                <Stage2

                  skill={skill}

                  answers={stage2Answers}

                  setAnswers={setStage2Answers}

                  context={context}

                />

                <Row style={{ justifyContent: "space-between", flexWrap: "wrap" }}>

                  <button

                    type="button"

                    style={styles.button("secondary")}

                    onClick={() => setStage(1)}

                  >

                    Back

                  </button>

                  <button

                    type="button"

                    style={styles.button("primary")}

                    onClick={() => {

                      if (!canContinueStage2()) return;

                      endStage("stage2");

                      setStage(3);

                      Analytics.track("stage2_complete", { skill, context });

                    }}

                  >

                    Continue <ArrowRight />

                  </button>

                </Row>

              </>

            ) : null}



            {stage === 3 ? (

              <>

                <MicroTask

                  skill={skill}

                  onDone={(signals) => {

                    setStage3Signals(signals || {});

                    endStage("stage3");

                    setStage(4);

                    finalizeReport();

                  }}

                />

              </>

            ) : null}



            {stage === 4 && report ? (

              <ReportView

                report={report}

                onStartNew={() => resetAssessment()}

                onExport={() => exportReport()}

              />

            ) : null}

          </div>

        )}

      </div>

    </div>

  );

}



